Q1 - Why did you use ArrayList?

I chose ArrayList because my application performs more read operations than insert/delete operations.
ArrayList provides O(1) random access using indexes because it is backed by a dynamic array.
Since the number of books isn't expected to change frequently, ArrayList is a good fit.

